<title>USA: FINAL PRICING -- Modesto Financing Authority.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING -- Modesto Financing Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>MODESTO PUBLIC FINANCING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $3,605,000*</p>
<p>LEASE REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>(John Thurman Field Renovation Project)</p>
<p>NOTE THE CHANGE IN THE FINAL AMOUNT.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Baa1		S&amp;P: BBB+</p>
<p>    DATED: 01/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 05/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>11/01/2016		3,605M    6.125 %	  6.25</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 98.58 )</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 11/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 11/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, January 16, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on January 23, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
